data: {"id": "6dd0afaf44254aa6-thinking-parallel_evidence-2720", "run_id": "6dd0afaf44254aa6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实汇总（aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8）：\n\n**身份与拓扑**\n- Pod UID `08e11260-...`，运行在 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.6`。\n- Owner: `ReplicaSet/workload-7679bcf76`；Service: `workload-svc` (selector `app.kubernetes.io/name: workload`)。\n- 容器: `app`。\n\n**CrashLoopBackOff 状态证据**\n- Events: `Warning BackOff` (x157 over 37m)，确认 Kubernetes 正在 Back-off 重启失败的 `app` 容器。\n- Metrics (`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`): 值从 1 单调增至 11 (最近数据点 19:08:58Z)，趋势可评估且仍在增长，证明崩溃是持续性的，未恢复。\n\n**崩溃根因日志证据**\n- 当前日志 (`kubectl_l", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789067436269, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

